  "id": "wither-side-head-firing-slots",
  "title": "Wither side-head target slot and skull direction",
  "category": "entities",
  "description": "Two separately tracked sheep distinguish the target slots associated with each physical skull origin. Requires the companion raw-packet regression checker; command controls alone cannot detect the defect.",
